			"notes": "## ApothSB 1.0.0\n\nFixes Apotheosis gems being rejected by Sophisticated Backpacks tag filter slots.\n\n### Changes\n- Added apotheosis:gem item tag injection so GemItem stacks are recognized by Sophisticated Backpacks' tag filter slot\n- Fixes the tag selection slot rejecting Apotheosis gems when filtering by tag in filter, pickup, and magnet upgrades\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.20.1\n- Forge 47.x\n- Apotheosis 7.x\n- Sophisticated Backpacks 3.x\n\n### Installation\nDownload the jar and place it in your mods folder alongside Apotheosis and Sophisticated Backpacks."
